  "explanation": "This is a model prediction: 71.8% Mozzarella (low-moisture) + 28.2% Mozzarella di Bufala Campana scores profile stretch 9.0, melt 8.0, browning 6.15 vs target 9.0/8.0/6.0.\n\nLow-moisture drives stretch/melt/browning via hot-water stretching at ~71C aligning casein fibers, pH 5.2-5.4 solubilizing colloidal calcium phosphate, and residual galactose + whey protein Maillard. Measured acetic acid 11080 µg/kg, butanoic acid 3190 µg/kg, diacetyl 2590 µg/kg https://iris.unirc.it/retrieve/443c8567-a968-4c04-a64d-b1395b287fcd/foods-13-00209.pdf\n\nBufala drives milky creaminess 4.13 with moisture 59.1%, pH 5.56, diacetyl 1590 µg/kg, acetoin 3310 µg/kg https://doi.org/10.3390/foods13020209, lifting buttery to 5.4 and sour to 4.08 for light tang.\n",
